{"id":"vod_bf_8361","vodId":"8361","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"盾之勇者成名录第一季","name_cn":"盾之勇者成名录第一季","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-9/ee19688eded9a84ace6f9bb85f109602.jpg"},"summary":"岩谷尚文（石川界人 配音）是一个内心里充满了正义感的青年，对世界上发生的很多不公平的事情都深感愤怒。一次偶然中，他被传送到了异世界里，成为了能够使用各种各样不同功能的盾牌的盾之勇者。本以为可以就此展开伸张正义的旅途，哪知道刚刚过去几天，他就经历了战友的背叛，而且丢掉了所有的财物。尚文发誓再也不要信任这个世界里的任何人了。　　就在这个节骨眼上，尚文的面前出现了一位名为拉芙塔利亚（濑户麻沙美 配音）的少女，拉芙塔利亚是一名奴隶，尚文决定用金钱来换取忠诚将她买下，在相处的过程中，拉芙塔利亚渐渐爱上了自己的主人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 18:29:47","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"}